&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Data Analyst with strong expertise in data warehousing, pipelines, APIs,&amp;nbsp;SQL, Python, and BI tools. The ideal candidate will transform data into actionable insights and&amp;nbsp;support business decision-making.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Build, maintain, and optimize data pipelines and workflows&lt;br&gt;• Work with Azure-based data warehousing solutions to ensure clean and reliable data&lt;br&gt;• Integrate and extract data using APIs&lt;br&gt;• Write efficient and complex SQL queries for analysis&lt;br&gt;• Use Python for data processing, automation, and pipeline development&lt;br&gt;• Develop dashboards and reports using BI tools (e.g., Power BI)&lt;br&gt;• Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define data requirements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 2–3 years of experience in data analytics or a similar role&lt;br&gt;• Strong expertise in SQL and Python&lt;br&gt;• Hands-on experience with Azure data services (e.g., Azure Data Factory, Synapse, etc.)&lt;br&gt;• Experience building and managing ETL/ELT pipelines&lt;br&gt;• Solid understanding of data warehousing concepts&lt;br&gt;• Experience working with APIs and data integration&lt;br&gt;• Proficiency in BI tools (Power BI preferred)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience in SaaS or subscription-based business models&lt;br&gt;• Familiarity with data lakes and modern data architecture&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Professional Environment: A collaborative and dynamic workplace.&lt;br&gt;• Competitive Salary: Market-leading compensation.&lt;br&gt;• Comprehensive Benefits: Medical insurance (including family), OPD, provident fund.&lt;br&gt;• Work-Life Balance: Maximum 45 weekly hours (Monday-&lt;br&gt;Friday), 29 annual leaves, capped sick &amp;amp; compassionate leaves.&lt;br&gt;• Perks: gym facility, annual company trip, quarterly team activities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hiring Process:&lt;br&gt;• Initial Screening: HR screening call.&lt;br&gt;• First Interview: Team lead and line lead interview.&lt;br&gt;• Technical Assessment: In-house test.&lt;br&gt;• Final Interview: Interview with the manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Important Information:&lt;br&gt;• Location: Onsite job with offices in Thokar.&lt;br&gt;• Working Hours: 8:00-4:30 PM (UK Time), subject to change as per business requirement.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand Generation Manager&lt;/strong&gt; sits at the heart of Joblogic&#39;s commercial growth strategy. As a &lt;strong&gt;Demand Generation Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be responsible for turning marketing strategy into measurable pipeline by planning, orchestrating and continuously optimising integrated demand generation programmes across the full customer acquisition journey. Working alongside the Head of Demand Generation, you&#39;ll own the coordination and delivery of campaigns across multiple channels, collaborating with Brand, Product, Customer Marketing, Sales, SDRs, RevOps and our Shared Delivery &amp;amp; Automation Studio to ensure every campaign delivers commercial impact.&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who thinks commercially, enjoys solving problems, loves improving conversion rates and thrives on building repeatable growth engines.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll spend as much time analysing funnel performance, identifying optimisation opportunities and experimenting with new approaches as you will launching campaigns.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;To develop, coordinate and continuously improve integrated demand generation programmes that create measurable pipeline, improve conversion, maximise marketing efficiency and contribute directly to revenue growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Accountabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Demand Generation Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Head of Demand Generation in developing and executing Joblogic&#39;s demand generation strategy across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategic priorities into integrated marketing programmes that generate qualified pipeline and measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance long-term planning with agile campaign execution to ensure marketing remains responsive to changing business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Commercial Accountability&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the marketing contribution to qualified pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure campaign success through commercial outcomes rather than activity metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and RevOps to understand where pipeline is created, where it leaks and where marketing can have the greatest commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve marketing efficiency through data-driven decision making and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign Planning &amp;amp; Orchestration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, coordinate and deliver integrated demand generation campaigns across multiple channels including paid media, outbound, email, webinars, events, partnerships, content and ABM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear campaign briefs, define objectives and coordinate delivery through the Shared Delivery &amp;amp; Automation Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaigns remain aligned to commercial priorities, delivered on time and measured effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple concurrent programmes while maintaining exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Account-Based Marketing (ABM)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own strategic account-based marketing programmes for enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and SDRs to develop personalised, multi-channel engagement strategies across priority accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate messaging, outreach, content and campaign activity that creates opportunities within named accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimise ABM programmes using insight and performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Funnel Optimisation &amp;amp; Conversion&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own continuous optimisation of the marketing funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion across every stage of the customer journey, from first interaction through to qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the GTM Experience Manager to implement improvements across landing pages, workflows, automation, lead routing, nurture journeys and campaign experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of continuous experimentation to improve marketing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Product Launches &amp;amp; Go-to-Market&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing and Product teams to support new product launches and AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate integrated go-to-market campaigns that educate prospects, generate demand and create pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure launches are commercially focused and supported by compelling messaging, content and campaign assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Partner Marketing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and coordinate joint demand generation campaigns with technology partners, industry associations and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create integrated programmes that expand audience reach while maintaining a consistent customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the commercial contribution of partner marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI-Enabled Marketing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leverage AI technologies to improve campaign planning, execution and optimisation.&lt;br&gt;Work alongside Joblogic&#39;s growing AI capabilities, including:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Search Visibility (AirOps)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clay for prospect research and enrichment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI SDR Agents to improve marketing-to-sales engagement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-assisted campaign planning and content production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing automation and intelligent workflows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Continuously identify opportunities to automate repetitive activities, improve marketing effectiveness and enhance customer experiences through AI.&lt;br&gt;Remain informed about emerging AI capabilities and recommend opportunities that strengthen Joblogic&#39;s go-to-market strategy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Insight&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build meaningful reporting that measures marketing performance through commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse campaign, channel and funnel performance to identify trends, opportunities and areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop actionable recommendations based on data rather than assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support attribution modelling and marketing performance reporting alongside RevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-functional Leadership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work closely with: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand &amp;amp; Market Influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SDRs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RevOps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM Experience Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shared Delivery &amp;amp; Automation Studio&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build trusted relationships across the business and ensure marketing activity remains aligned to wider commercial priorities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Measures &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Commercial&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Qualified Pipeline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline Created&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Influenced Revenue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign ROI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Efficiency Ratio (MER)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost per Pipeline Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Funnel Performance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MQL to SAL Conversion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAL to SQL Conversion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Landing Page Conversion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Email Performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Attribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline Velocity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategic&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ABM programme performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product launch success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner campaign contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-enabled campaign adoption&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimentation programme maturity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering demand generation programmes within a B2B SaaS organisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial understanding of marketing&#39;s role in revenue generation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning integrated multi-channel marketing campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of account-based marketing and full-funnel demand generation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent campaign planning and project coordination skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capability with experience interpreting marketing performance data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM and marketing automation platforms such as HubSpot.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Desirable&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI within marketing workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Clay, AirOps or similar AI-powered GTM tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of outbound marketing and SDR collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event marketing experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS or Field Service Management experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within high-growth technology businesses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Attributes &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who is naturally curious about growth and enjoys finding better ways to generate demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be commercially minded, analytical and proactive, always looking beyond campaign delivery to understand how marketing contributes to business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll enjoy experimenting, testing ideas and learning quickly from results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly organised, collaborative and comfortable working across multiple teams, bringing people together to deliver exceptional marketing programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most importantly, you&#39;ll thrive in an environment where strategy, technology and AI combine to create measurable commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Growth team combines strategic thinking, specialist expertise and AI-powered execution to deliver measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll work across multiple disciplines, partnering with specialists in Brand, Customer Marketing, GTM Experience, Product, Sales and RevOps to deliver integrated growth programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe great marketers combine creativity with commercial thinking, curiosity with discipline, and technology with human insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is embedded into how we work, helping us move faster, make better decisions and automate repetitive tasks so our people can focus on strategy, creativity and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like After 12 Months &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand Generation Management is generating predictable, measurable pipeline across every major acquisition channel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaigns are fully integrated across Brand, Product, Customer Marketing, Sales and SDRs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conversion rates have improved across key stages of the marketing funnel through continuous experimentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI capabilities are embedded into campaign planning, optimisation and reporting, improving both efficiency and effectiveness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise ABM programmes are consistently creating high-value opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing is recognised as a strategic commercial function that contributes directly to pipeline growth, marketing efficiency and revenue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a revenue-owning, new-business role. You will own a defined UK enterprise territory and carry a monthly new-business ARR target. You are expected to aggressively self-generate the bulk of your own pipeline, supplemented by leads supplied into your territory, running complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles on the Joblogic platform, qualifying rigorously with MEDDPICC and selling consultatively to operational and executive buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Head of Sales and work closely with an SDR, marketing, and product. This is a hunting seat. If you want to farm a book of existing accounts or wait for leads to land in your diary, this isn&#39;t it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Own the number&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry a monthly new-business closed-ARR target in a defined UK enterprise territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full cycle from first touch to signature, including commercials and negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and defend an accurate forecast you are prepared to be held to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Self-generate pipeline aggressively&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the bulk of your pipeline through relentless outbound, networking, and territory planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplied and marketing-sourced leads are a supplement, not the plan - you own your own number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain pipeline coverage against target ahead of each month, not in reaction to it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Run complex enterprise sales cycles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and progress deals using MEDDPICC (Metrics, Economic Buyer, Decision Criteria, Decision Process, Paper Process, Identify Pain, Champion, Competition)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-thread across operational, technical, procurement, and executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and validate a genuine economic buyer and a compelling event on every deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Sell consultatively&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with discovery, not demo; diagnose the operational and commercial problem before positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame value in the customer&#39;s terms - margin, compliance, engineer productivity, growth - not feature lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge the status quo and reframe how the buyer thinks about their operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Forecast with discipline in HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep deal stage, ARR, close date, source, and next step current in HubSpot at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean MEDDPICC qualification data so forecast calls are evidence-based&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Work cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your aligned SDR to build, prioritise, and convert outbound into the territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing on campaigns and follow-up, and feed territory and competitive intelligence back to product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Be Measured&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New-business closed ARR against monthly target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-generated pipeline coverage and quality in territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC qualification discipline and stage progression health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win rate and average deal size within the assigned territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accuracy against committed numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales-cycle velocity - time from qualified opportunity to closed won&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quota ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;A demonstrable track record of closing new-business ARR in a B2B SaaS environment, in a role where you carried and hit a personal number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-generation: &lt;/strong&gt;You have consistently self-sourced pipeline, not relied on marketing or SDRs to feed you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MEDDPICC: &lt;/strong&gt;Proficient and disciplined with MEDDPICC (or MEDDIC) on complex, multi-stakeholder deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative selling: &lt;/strong&gt;A discovery-led, challenger-style seller who diagnoses before prescribing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM discipline: &lt;/strong&gt;Active HubSpot user who runs an accurate pipeline and forecast in the CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational AI use: &lt;/strong&gt;You use AI tools daily and can describe specifically what you have built, automated, or accelerated with them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment fit: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in a PE-backed or high-growth SaaS environment, comfortable with monthly accountability and ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise or mid-market deal experience with multi-stakeholder cycles and £50k+ ARR deal sizes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in UK SaaS at £10M-£60M ARR - close enough to our stage to have relevant scar tissue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with FSM, trades, or vertical SaaS - Xero, Sage, or similar buyer profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into facilities management, maintenance contractors, or the built environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership language: &lt;/strong&gt;You say &quot;I closed&quot;, &quot;I owned the number&quot;, &quot;I built my pipeline&quot;, not &quot;we hit target&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial framing: &lt;/strong&gt;You measure yourself in ARR, pipeline, and win rate, not activity or meetings held&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter mentality: &lt;/strong&gt;You are energised by generating your own demand and opening doors others can&#39;t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative instinct: &lt;/strong&gt;You earn the right to sell by understanding the operation before you pitch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational AI use: &lt;/strong&gt;You have built workflows or automations with AI, not just experimented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PE environment fit: &lt;/strong&gt;You understand quarterly cadence and investor-grade reporting at a Vista-backed business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect - &lt;/strong&gt;We treat colleagues, partners, and customers with professionalism and empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsession with Customers - &lt;/strong&gt;We focus on solving real operational problems and delivering meaningful value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability - &lt;/strong&gt;We take ownership of outcomes and hold ourselves to high standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rethink Tomorrow - &lt;/strong&gt;We embrace innovation and continuously improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joblogic&#39;s growth targets require multiple, reliable sources of new-business revenue. Enterprise and complex deals are where our platform is most differentiated and most defensible. This seat exists to win those deals: to self-generate demand and convert supplied leads in a defined territory, run disciplined cycles, and turn them into ARR that compounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will do it with the backing of a PE-funded SaaS business on the path to becoming one of the UK&#39;s fastest-growing software companies, and with the infrastructure, enablement, and pre-sales support to win at pace.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;About the Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:400,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
