&lt;h2 id=&quot;about_the_role_0&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for highly motivated &lt;strong&gt;Outbound Sales Development Representatives&lt;/strong&gt; (SDRs) to join our growing global sales team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an SDR at Joblogic, you will play a critical role in driving new business growth by identifying and engaging potential customers across the UK market. You will be responsible for prospecting, cold calling, qualifying leads, and booking product demonstrations for our Account Executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thrives in a high-performance sales environment, enjoys building conversations with decision-makers, and wants to develop a long-term career in B2B SaaS sales.&lt;/p&gt;
