&lt;li&gt;Conduct &lt;strong&gt;high-volume outbound prospecting&lt;/strong&gt; through cold calls, emails, and LinkedIn outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with &lt;strong&gt;decision-makers including business owners, directors, and operations leaders&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify prospects and identify their business challenges and operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book &lt;strong&gt;qualified product demos and discovery meetings&lt;/strong&gt; for the Account Executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage prospecting activity, sequences, and pipeline updates within CRM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work towards &lt;strong&gt;monthly and quarterly KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; including calls, conversations, meetings booked, and pipeline generated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with &lt;strong&gt;Marketing and Sales&lt;/strong&gt; to optimise outreach campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve outreach messaging, objection handling, and prospect engagement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
