&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about_the_role_0&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-weight-bold&quot;&gt;As part of our growing Migrations team, you will play a key role in helping businesses transition from legacy FSM platforms to Joblogic.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will be provided with pre-qualified demonstrations while also generating your own opportunities. You will manage the full sales cycle from discovery through to close, delivering product demonstrations both online and face-to-face while clearly articulating the operational and financial value of moving to Joblogic.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role requires a consultative approach, strong presentation skills, and the ability to guide customers confidently through the decision to migrate their operational systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_your_main_focus_will_be_1&quot;&gt;What your main focus will be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carrying out product demonstrations to pre-qualified prospects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing tailored sales proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting SLAs and achieving monthly, quarterly, and annual revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining accurate pipeline management and CRM updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping calendars updated with calls, sessions, and demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage prospecting activity, sequences, and pipeline updates within CRM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updating internal systems with relevant information and scheduling follow-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurturing client relationships through regular communication via phone and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiating deals with prospects and guiding them through the buying process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with other departments to ensure a smooth customer handover post-sale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staying updated on product developments and upcoming releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travelling where required, sometimes involving overnight stays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending office meetings and company exhibitions as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_you_bring_2&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who combines strong sales fundamentals with the curiosity and resilience required to sell into operational businesses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will likely bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in B2B software, technology, or solution-based sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence delivering product demonstrations and presentations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage a structured sales process from discovery through to close&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative approach with the ability to understand customer operations and identify value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and CRM discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset with the ability to generate new opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The drive to succeed in a fast-scaling SaaS environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;nice_to_have_points_3&quot;&gt;Nice-to-have points&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling SaaS platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in FSM, CAFM, or facilities management industries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to migrations, platform replacements, or operational software transitions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;remuneration_package_and_benefits_4&quot;&gt;Remuneration package and benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Joblogic, we care about helping you do your best work and grow along the way. Here’s what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market competitive salary range – commensurate with your experience and abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within a global SaaS product company with strong growth momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work closely with international teams across UK, Pakistan, and Vietnam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear career progression opportunities as Joblogic continues to scale globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and fast-paced working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company events and team activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities through Joblogic Academy and internal training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Senior Customer Success Manager, Strategic Accounts, you will own a portfolio of&amp;nbsp;Joblogic’s&amp;nbsp;most complex, high-value enterprise customers — accountable for retention, expansion, and long-term value&amp;nbsp;realisation&amp;nbsp;across every account in your book.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is not a reactive support role. You will&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;as a trusted commercial partner to your customers — diagnosing value gaps, influencing senior stakeholders, building structured success plans, and driving the adoption that leads directly to retention and growth. You will be expected to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;and close expansion opportunities independently, lead executive-level commercial conversations, and protect revenue through&amp;nbsp;deep&amp;nbsp;understanding of customer outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will sit within&amp;nbsp;Joblogic’s&amp;nbsp;newly built Strategic CS function, working closely with the Senior Manager, Strategic Accounts and partnering with Sales, Product, Implementation, and Support as the business scales internationally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
